---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'June 1, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — CrawlGap"
  description="Read CrawlGap's Terms of Service. Understand your rights and responsibilities when using our SEO intelligence platform."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="legal-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-header">
          <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Service</h1>
          <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-body">
          <div class="legal-toc glass-card">
            <h2 class="toc-title">Table of Contents</h2>
            <ol class="toc-list">
              <li><a href="#acceptance">Acceptance of Terms</a></li>
              <li><a href="#services">Description of Services</a></li>
              <li><a href="#user-accounts">User Accounts</a></li>
              <li><a href="#acceptable-use">Acceptable Use</a></li>
              <li><a href="#scraping">Scraping & Crawling Policy</a></li>
              <li><a href="#data">Data & Privacy</a></li>
              <li><a href="#payment">Payment & Billing</a></li>
              <li><a href="#termination">Termination</a></li>
              <li><a href="#liability">Limitation of Liability</a></li>
              <li><a href="#contact">Contact Information</a></li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="legal-content">
            <section id="acceptance" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
              <p>By accessing or using CrawlGap ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to all terms, do not use the Service.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="services" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>2. Description of Services</h2>
              <p>CrawlGap provides automated competitor sitemap analysis, blog URL extraction, SEO keyword discovery, and content gap analysis tools. The Service is provided "as is" and we reserve the right to modify features at any time.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="user-accounts" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>3. User Accounts</h2>
              <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account. You must be at least 18 years old to use the Service.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="acceptable-use" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>4. Acceptable Use</h2>
              <p>You agree not to use CrawlGap to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Scrape or crawl websites without authorization or in violation of their terms of service</li>
                <li>Cause disruption, excessive load, or denial-of-service conditions on target websites</li>
                <li>Collect personal data about individuals from scraped content</li>
                <li>Resell or redistribute our data or analysis without written permission</li>
                <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or hack the platform</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section id="scraping" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>5. Scraping & Crawling Policy</h2>
              <p>By using CrawlGap's scanning features, you acknowledge and agree that:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>You are solely responsible for ensuring you have the legal right to analyze each target website</li>
                <li>You will comply with the target website's robots.txt and terms of service</li>
                <li>CrawlGap is a tool — we are not responsible for your use of scraped data</li>
                <li>We reserve the right to disable scanning for specific domains flagged as sensitive</li>
              </ul>
              <p>CrawlGap automatically respects Crawl-delay directives and applies randomized rate limiting, but this does not guarantee compliance with every site's terms of service.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="data" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>6. Data & Privacy</h2>
              <p>Scraped content is stored for processing only and automatically deleted after 30 days. We do not extract, store, or process personal data found in scraped content. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for full details.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="payment" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>7. Payment & Billing</h2>
              <p>Paid subscriptions are billed monthly or annually. You may cancel at any time; access continues until the end of the current billing period. We do not offer refunds for partial months unless required by applicable law.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="termination" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>8. Termination</h2>
              <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms, with or without notice. You may terminate your account at any time through your account settings.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="liability" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
              <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, CrawlGap shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service. Our total liability to you shall not exceed the amount paid by you in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>
            </section>

            <section id="contact" class="legal-section-block">
              <h2>10. Contact Information</h2>
              <p>For legal inquiries, contact: <a href="mailto:legal@sitemapseo.io">legal@sitemapseo.io</a></p>
              <p>CrawlGap Inc., 123 Innovation Drive, San Francisco, CA 94105</p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-main { padding-top: 72px; }
  .legal-section { padding: clamp(4rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0; }

  .legal-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  .legal-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) { .legal-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .legal-toc {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) { .legal-toc { position: static; } }

  .toc-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .toc-list {
    list-style: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .toc-list a {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .toc-list a:hover { color: var(--color-teal); }

  .legal-content { max-width: 800px; }

  .legal-section-block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-section-block:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 96px;
  }

  .legal-section-block p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-section-block ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-section-block li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .legal-section-block a { color: var(--color-teal); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
